      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>A primary node agent that runs on each node in the cluster to ensure that containers are running in a pod.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Kubernetes</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Kubernetes is an open source container orchestration engine for automating deployment, scaling, and management of containerized applications.</p></dd>
