      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>A managed {"{"}{"{"} op_system_base {"}"}{"}"} OpenShift Container Platform offering on Amazon Web Services (AWS) and {"{"}{"{"} gcp_first {"}"}{"}"}. OpenShift Dedicated focuses on building and scaling applications.</p></dd>
